strictly positive point, rejected:
  invalid dual kernel key 53221801103618419 (rank deficient or D(A) empty)

A full current-checker replay of the 36,128 deposited m=7 certificates was
completed earlier in this correction pass by splitting the stream into 40 exact
substreams and aggregating their independent PASS lines:
  PASS certs=36128 fixed=36119 adaptive=9
       boundary_single_or_sum=1282
       boundary_coalition_checks=0
       coalition_checks=4594479
       min_positive_endpoint=1/364

The global domain D(A) is now required to be nonempty and strictly positive.
Only a coalition implication may pass because its saturation-restricted
antecedent domain is empty; singleton and adaptive-sum claims cannot pass
vacuously.

