Unresolved release blocker and scope boundary
---------------------------------------------
The three files above are still absent. The complete square-stage kernel audit,
1,049,187-record coverage check, and dual signed-rational/GMP replay therefore
were not executed from this compact archive in this correction pass. The package
is deliberately labeled code-corrected/data-incomplete and must not be released
as a data-complete theorem artifact until those files are deposited or
regenerated and scripts/verify_n8.sh succeeds.

The combined scripts/verify_n8_available.sh entry point was not rerun as one
monolithic command after the final documentation/regression-script edits;
proof-relevant source was unchanged by those edits. Its constituent current-code
checks above include the complete m=7 exact replay and the m=8 exceptional-case
replay.
